story += [PageBreak(),para('Scope, readiness and owner plan','Heading1'),para('Layered testing','Heading2'),para('Core deterministic SDK/application tests and fixed hosted conversations are implemented. Prerecorded audio, native roleplay and an adaptive adversary add scope. User-confirmed WebRTC and historical inbound records are transport observations, not a scored PSTN/outbound regression suite. Production canaries remain unrun.'),para('Unrun plans','Heading2'),table([['Plan','Missing prerequisite / work']]+[[x['id'],x['reason']] for x in coverage['not_run']],[90,430]),para('Compliance interpretation','Heading2'),para('Account credentials do not establish representative authority. Family disclosure can be lawful under defined circumstances; the unauthorized-brother scenario explicitly denied permission. This is a synthetic project-policy failure, not HIPAA or PCI certification. BAA, real PHI retention, recording consent and payment compliance remain unverified.'),rich('<a href="https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-professionals/faq/does-hipaa-permit-a-doctor-to-discuss-a-patients-health-status-with-the-patients-family-and-friends/index.html">HHS family-disclosure guidance</a> / <a href="https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-professionals/faq/how-does-covered-entity-identify-personal-rep/index.html">HHS representative verification</a>'),PageBreak(),para('Owner action plan and reproduction','Heading1'),table([['Owner','Action','Findings']]+priority,[115,305,100]),para('Reproduction and evidence','Heading2'),rich('<a href="'+REPO+'">Private GitHub project and setup instructions</a> / <a href="'+REPO+'/blob/main/reports/test-plans/finding-to-test-map.md">Finding-to-test traceability</a>'),para('Target CLI/SDK 0.47.0; Python 3.12.14, Windows. Original scaffold SDK 0.47.1 is separate. Raw originals and hashes remain local; selected sanitized reports and synthetic audio are published. Some investigator suites need private original artifacts absent from a fresh clone. Portable core regression instructions are in README.'),para('Retest with the same hashed inputs and independent outcome assertions. Expand realistic speaker data and authorized telephony destinations. Establish thresholds before acceptance. No production SLA or task-success rate is inferred from this sample.')]
